        },
        {
          "text": "nekubaboobo yasyangwa buyo, ilakomena, ilaba impati kwiinda misamu yoonse, akusonsa mitabi mipati, elyo bayuni bakujulu balakonzya kukala mucenzule cayo.",
          "type": "text",
